                        <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--bi-navy);font-weight:500;">Enrolling at Britts Imperial is simple, and we'll guide you through every step.</p>



                        <h3>Before You Enrol</h3>

                        <p>All applicants complete a pre-training review and a Language, Literacy, Numeracy and Digital (LLND) assessment, so we can confirm the course is right for you and arrange any support you may need.</p>



                        <h3>Eligibility</h3>

                        <p>There are no formal entry requirements under the training package for these qualifications. Britts Imperial applies its own entry requirements, including a satisfactory LLN result and basic digital literacy, which are confirmed during the pre-enrolment process and set out in the Student Handbook.</p>



                        <h3>Unique Student Identifier (USI)</h3>

                        <p>Under Australian Government requirements, every student undertaking nationally recognised training must have a USI before we can issue a qualification or statement of attainment. If you don't already have one, you can create your USI for free at <a href="https://www.usi.gov.au" target="_blank">usi.gov.au</a>, or we can help you during enrolment.</p>



                        <h3>What to Bring</h3>

                        <ul>

                            <li>Photo identification (for example, driver licence or passport)</li>

                            <li>Your USI (or details to create one)</li>

                            <li>Evidence of prior study or experience, if you wish to apply for credit transfer (CT) or recognition of prior learning (RPL)</li>

                            <li>A completed enrolment form</li>

                        </ul>



                        <h3>How to Enrol</h3>

                        <ul class="bi-steps">

                            <li>Submit an enrolment enquiry or request an enrolment form.</li>

                            <li>Complete the pre-training review and LLND assessment.</li>

                            <li>Receive and sign your written enrolment agreement, confirming your course, fees and rights.</li>

                            <li>Attend orientation and begin your studies.</li>

                        </ul>



                        <p>Contact us to request an enrolment form or to speak with our admissions team.</p>

                        <div class="bi-btn-group">

                            <a href="Contact.aspx" class="btn btn-theme effect btn-md">Request Enrolment Form</a>

                            <a href="Downloads.aspx" class="btn btn-dark border btn-md">Download Centre</a>

                        </div>

                    </div>

